# Hopeless Nightmare ruling (2023-09-01): the opponent loses 2 life even if unable to discard. Bot2 empties its hand on turn 2
# (a land and seven free artifacts, the turn-2 draw included), then Bot1 casts the enchantment on turn 3: nothing is asked of
# Bot2, its graveyard stays empty, and it still loses 2 life (20 -> 18).

